    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d543">

                <pb facs="0860" n="838" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg838"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/1–352: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-01-03T16:52:00+01:00">January 3,
                            1952—4:52 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 581. Re Delga 828 and 829 January 3 you are auth ur discretion to abstain
                    on Res Third Comite auth HC appeal for asst funds.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
